A '''Schoolgirl''' (Japanese: '''スクールガール''' ''Schoolgirl'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] introduced in [[Generation VI]]. In [[Kalos]], they are depicted as young girls dressed in school uniforms who carry a [[Bag|backpack]] around with them. They could be considered elder versions of the {{tc|School Kid}} class. In [[Galar]], they are notably younger and dress up more casually.

